WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.650
when the children go home,

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:35.650
I'm Kurata Sana, age 11.
I'm a sixth grader,

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:37.530
who's also a TV personality,
and in Gekidan Komawari.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.620
Mama. An Aoki Laureate novelist

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:41.200
with a nice objet d'art
for every day of the week.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.950
Hayama Akito. Former monkey boss,
former lonely wolf,

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:48.370
whose strange family problems have
come to a happy ending, for now.

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:51.210
Yay!

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:52.880
--Get out of the way!
--How come?

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:54.630
And, suddenly becoming more
prominent this episode,

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:55.590
my manager, boyfriend and pimp, Rei-kun.

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:57.930
Rei-kun is my boyfriend!

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:01.850
And yet, this mysterious actress,
Kurumi Asako-san, appears before him!

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:05.520
What? What? What?
What are you to Rei-kun?

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:10.520
It's been a long time.
You've been avoiding me, haven't you?

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:11.860
All this time...

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:15.190
I didn't see you once the whole
time we were shooting, after all.

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:17.860
Um, could you be mistaking me
for someone else?

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:19.200
You can't play dumb with me!

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.530
What's going on!?
Take off those sunglasses!

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:23.200
Show me your face!

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:28.210
My adorable girlfriend ordered me
not to, so I won't take them off.

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:31.460
What is this? How much of this is real?

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:34.210
I don't see you for a little while,
and you develop a Lolita complex?

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:36.300
No matter what others
may say, right now,

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:38.420
that girl is more important
to me than anything.

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:42.890
No... no... Rei-kun is...

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:44.890
...my boyfriend!

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.220
Show me your face!

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:48.640
Take off those sunglasses!

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:53.310
Rei...

00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:03.200
"A Juice-Drenched First Kiss"

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.420
Excuse me for showing my regular face.

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:11.830
Who are you talking to?

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.550
I don't care if you are Asako-san,
this is wrong!

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.760
You keep your hands off of Rei-kun!

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.430
Glasses with eyes in them!

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:22.680
Komawari somersault!!

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:31.060
Rei, why are you staying
at Sana-chan's home?

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.690
That's none of your business, baby.

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:35.690
"Baby"? Rei-kun, you know Asako-san?

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:38.360
We used to date,
back in our high school days.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:39.030
Asako!

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.360
"Asako"!? With no name-suffix?

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:42.700
Ah, but now, I have
nothing to do with her.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:45.030
--What's this? You're mistaken
about a few things!
--You dated her? "Baby"? "Baby"? "Asako"?

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:46.370
--I'm...
--You dated your baby, "Asako"?

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.700
--Ah, there you are!
--Oh, and when you could see the moon,

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.040
--What are you doing, Asako-chan?
--on those dates,

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.710
--Hurry, we have a car waiting over here.
--you wore a lucky evening primrose...

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:51.710
--Wait, I'm still talking!
--And when eating dumplings,

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:53.710
--Geez, don't you remember
how famous you are?
--you eat them

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:54.710
--No!
--with soba and eggs.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.380
Ah! It's Kurumi Asako!

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.050
Oh, you're right!

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:00.470
It's Sana-chan! Sana-chan's here, too!

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:07.010
I still have some glasses
with eyes in them!

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.480
"Silence"

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.480
Come on, while everyone
is struck silent!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.060
Rei! Call me!

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:15.400
Asako-chan, hurry!

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:20.400
I want to talk! Rei, make sure
you call me! I'll be waiting!

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.360
Rei! Rei! Make sure you do! Rei!

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:25.910
Asako-san...

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:30.080
I thought it was strange, you know?

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:34.500
When we were shooting that drama earlier,
you would always wait in the car.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.000
Why did you keep it a secret?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.340
Well, it was already over
between us, and all...

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:42.010
Asako-san doesn't seem to think so.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.340
It's all right.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.300
Don't worry about a thing.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:55.020
Right now, you're the most
important thing to me, Sana-chan.

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:56.350
Really?

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:57.770
Mm-hmm.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.700
Now then...

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:08.160
It looked like Shimura-san
was getting supper ready.

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.030
I'm going to go help her out.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:10.200
Uh-huh.

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:16.370
The most important thing, he said...

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:19.460
I can trust you, right, Rei-kun?

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:23.550
It almost feels like I'm
the heroine of a Shojo manga!

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:25.760
I'm scattering flowers about!

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:32.930
Oh, yow! Hmm? What's this?

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:41.020
What is this!?

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:45.360
Huh? About Rei-kun?

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:49.370
Mm-hmm. I'm wondering once again
about what kind of person he is.

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:51.370
Like I said, he's my boyfriend.

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:53.370
I see...

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:57.040
But now, a woman from his past
has come up. Makes me feel icky.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.710
Pfft...

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:02.040
What are you cutting farts for
so early in the morning, Hayama?

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:07.470
I was laughing. Him, a boyfriend?
He's just pretending, you know.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.720
Pretending...?

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:15.270
There's no way he sees you as a woman.
And the woman from his past?

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:16.730
That's who he's really after.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.850
Akito-kun... that was pretty belligerent.

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:23.610
Why should I have to take
that coming from you!?

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:25.860
This has absolutely nothing
to do with you, does it!?

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:31.070
She opened the door just by snorting!

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.330
That's Sana-chan for you.

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:37.330
Akito-kun, why would you do something
like that to anger Sana-chan?

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:44.670
The woman from his past is who he's
really after...? That might be true.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:48.300
Otherwise, would he collect
all of those clippings of her?

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:50.680
Sure he would!

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:53.180
He nailed them to a tree in the dead
of night, and then, using black magic,

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:55.810
he tried to put a curse on her,
to kill her!

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:02.690
There's no way Rei-kun is
that kind of person, right!?

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.360
Ah, she startled me!

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:05.230
"Still..."

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:10.240
Still... still... you know...?

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:15.700
Still, still, you know...?
Still, you know...?

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.660
"Hayama, what was that look for?"

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.050
You sure are late, Sana-chan...

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:30.720
If you're looking for Sana-chan, I think
she went home through the rear gate.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:33.340
You're... Tsuyoshi-kun, right?

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:34.350
Good afternoon.

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:36.060
She's avoiding you.

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:38.640
The grouch boy, Hayama!

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:42.730
Is that right? Oh no, maybe she's
started to not like me. Okay then...

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:49.030
She went home without saying anything.
Could she be that angry?

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:52.320
Whoa! When did you...!?

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:54.990
There's something we need to talk about.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:57.120
Talk about, you say?

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.700
I'm home.

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.330
Huh? Where's Sagami-kun?

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.000
I ducked him and came home myself.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:09.260
Oh, my. Why, how come, for what
reason would you duck Sagami-kun?

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:13.220
Poor Sagami-kun!

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:16.760
She's thoroughly enjoying herself, huh?

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:23.730
Please, take your time.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:26.400
So, what is it we're talking about?

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:29.320
At least take off your sunglasses
when talking to others.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.070
You don't have any manners, do you?

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:35.200
I should warn you, I don't use polite
language with people older than me

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:36.660
if I don't have any respect for them.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:38.660
You little brat...

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:41.000
I- I beg your pardon.

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:44.330
Um, is it true that you're
Sana-chan's boyfriend?

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:46.000
Mm-hmm, that's right.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.670
Do you mean that seriously?

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.920
If so, I can't see you
as being anything

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:53.010
other than a pervert
with a Lolita complex.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:55.550
Somehow, it doesn't look like I'll
be able to brush this off, huh?

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.260
"In a pinch, Rei-kun?"

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:14.280
Rei-kun, things have gone so smoothly
between us up to now... Rei-kun...

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:23.040
Mama, you know what? Today, Sensei said
some terribly good things about me.

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:27.960
She said "Sana-chan, you'll be a star
in the future." Mama, are you listening?

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:30.710
Huh?

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:34.800
Say, Mama, what are those
people doing over there?

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:48.270
So, is it yummy? Oh, no, no!
Here, this is Noriben seaweed.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:50.650
It's really delicious!

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:54.320
Say, you don't have a home, right?
Come with me!

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:57.400
Mama, we're home! I brought
one of those homeless guys

00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:59.660
you were talking about earlier with me!

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.870
Holy--!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.330
Rei-kun!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:08.000
I really am grateful to that girl.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.540
Rei-kun!

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:15.800
--Thanks to her, I regained my spirits.
--Rei-kun, I've always wanted a boyfriend.
Will you be mine?

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:18.800
--That's why, even though
she might be a child,
--You can even be my pimp. I'll make sure

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:21.350
--when she thinks as
much of me as she does,
--to give you your allowance.

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:24.850
--I feel I have to think
as much about her back.
--I do a little work, myself.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:31.020
Sana-chan hired me to be her boyfriend,
as well as to look after her.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:34.980
So regardless of whatever might be
commonplace, I am Sana-chan's boyfriend.

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:39.320
I understand.

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:42.320
Huh? You're kidding. I don't get it.

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:44.660
Oh, that's okay, that's okay.

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:47.660
I wouldn't want you
to treat me to anything.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:51.080
In the end, you're just
making a fool of her.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.460
You're not in love with her, you know.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:57.670
You think that because she's a child,
things will cool off in time.

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:59.010
You really are just playing around,
aren't you?

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:00.720
Er, no, that's not true!

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:03.010
Hold on a minute, you don't
understand what I--

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:05.010
Enough!

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:07.470
Don't go around playing
children for fools.

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:16.280
Akito-kun, wait! Excuse us. Wait up!
Explain this to me from the top!

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:23.030
Akito-kun! Wait up, okay!?

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:24.910
Listen, Akito-kun,
you're acting strange!

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:29.370
Akito-kun, you aren't your usual self.
Why did you get so upset?

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:32.000
You like Kurata, don't you?

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.460
Uh-huh, I like her.

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:40.260
Well then, that makes us rivals.

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:11.410
R---l...? R---l...?

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:13.750
If you didn't hear me, that's fine.

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.750
J- just a minute!

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:18.090
I kind of heard it, but say it
once again to be sure.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:19.420
I'm only saying it once.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:22.090
You said I was your rival, didn't you?

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:24.090
I thought you didn't hear me.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:26.300
That's right, but there's only one thing

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:28.100
that starts with "R" and ends
with "L," isn't there?

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:32.430
Sure there's more. Rascal...
Hansel... Rubber sole... Russell...

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:36.690
Oh, you're right. There are quite a few.
That's something to think about.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:41.030
But... we can't be! No! I don't
like the way this is turning out!

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:44.530
Sure enough, it looks like Hayama-kun has
declared his rivalry with Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:48.080
If Tsuyoshi-kun likes Sana-chan,
and he is his rival,

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:49.370
then that must mean...

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:52.870
...Hayama-kun also likes Sana-chan.

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:57.380
Sana-chan only ever
thinks about Rei-kun,

00:12:57.380 --> 00:13:01.050
and there are two other boys
who like Sana-chan!

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:03.170
What to do about this!?

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.430
"Zenjiro's "Child's Toy""

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:12.730
My heart flutt-uhs at this
refreshing May weath-uh!

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:15.640
They call this "Fair May."

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:20.400
What's the matt-uh? It's awfully
quiet here in the classroom today.

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:22.690
This is a good opp-uh-tunity.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:25.400
Why don't we poik up our ea-uhs
and listen to the sounds of May?

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:29.740
Hold on a minute.
Today, Sana-chan is absent, isn't she?

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:31.740
Yes, she's absent.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:32.750
I'm late!

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:34.870
Excuse me!

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:40.040
Do you know how to read the woid
"May" when you stick "fly" next to it?

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.710
Is it "ouch"?

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:45.010
"Mayfly-y"

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:45.010
It's the word for "annoying"!

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:47.680
What's up, Sana-chan?
Did'ja sleep in again?

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:51.350
Actually, the train I
was riding had a flat.

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:54.310
Ah, and it took some time
for them to change the tire.

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:57.020
And what kind of train
has tires, you dummy!?

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:59.690
Still, it is true that I came by train.

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:02.570
Oh yeah? Not like you usually do,
in your boyfriend's car?

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:04.740
You aren't by any chance
having a fight, are you?

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:07.700
Something like that.
We're always so stuck together.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.030
I wonder if we don't need to
spend a little time apart

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:11.080
to take a look at ourselves.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:13.740
Well, shua. If you get too close to me,

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.750
all you can see are teeth,
and you'd say...

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.120
"Lemme alone!"

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.710
Come on, come on, you guys,
you're laughing too hard.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:23.380
Good teeth are the
lifeblood of a perform-uh!

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.340
You can't cawl yourselves
very good perform-uhs

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.720
if you laugh at someone's teeth!

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:29.720
Rei-kun!

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:32.760
You're dead serious, huh?

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:34.430
I'm home.

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:38.810
Sana-chan...

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:47.360
You called?

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:49.030
I called.

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:50.320
I see...

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:54.830
That was pretty harsh, going to
the studio by yourself like that.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:59.000
I did come home safely on the train, too.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:02.710
That's cold.

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:07.380
You were late, right?
It's not good to be late for work.

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:09.380
Sorry.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:13.260
You don't need to come
get me tomorrow, either.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:15.600
But...

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:20.140
I don't have any work tomorrow.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:24.020
We have a field trip in social studies,
so I'll come home with my friends.

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:28.400
I see. All right.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:29.780
Bye.

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.750
Rei-kun!

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:43.040
You're dead serious, huh?

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:58.060
Rei! Call me! I want to talk! Rei,
make sure you call me! I'll be waiting!

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:05.520
I don't know where to reach you.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:13.360
Depressing... too depressing...

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:16.660
"Times like these call for Mama's trusty
personality assessment notebook!"

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:21.000
"Right now, you're a
mass of devilish jealousy,

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:24.790
and cannot behave yourself,
even in front of the person you like"?

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.040
Depressing...

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:29.380
No, no, no, no, no, no, no!

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:32.380
With depressing feelings like these,
no matter how gifted an actress I may be,

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:34.760
they're going to show up on my face!

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:37.350
An actress' face is her life!

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:39.850
At times like this, I should sing
and blow them all out!

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:48.690
♪ "Back against the wall." That's what
you say about times like these. ♪

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:55.030
♪ In dire straits, I've been
waiting for an answer. ♪

00:16:57.030 --> 00:17:02.040
♪ "Dire straits" is pain
on fours and eights. ♪

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:06.380
♪ Put them together
and you get 15 pains. ♪

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:07.710
Your arithmetic is wrong!

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:11.050
♪ Pain and sadness, I welcome you! ♪

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:11.760
Huh?

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:14.380
♪ Yes, I welcome you. ♪

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:22.060
♪ What should I do now? ♪

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:29.730
No, no, no, no! How did my
song end up like that!?

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:32.990
This is why you should use your
Norinori machine at times like this.

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:33.990
You mean this!?

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:35.320
That's it!

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:38.990
♪ Actresses whose faces are
their lives should smile! ♪

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.990
♪ Smile when you say good morning,
smile when you say bye-bye! ♪

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:43.330
♪ Smiles are the earth's treasures. ♪

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.330
♪ When people smile,
the world becomes heaven, ♪

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:47.330
♪ and heaven -eaven -eaven
is a paradise all over! ♪

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:49.330
♪ When you feel discouraged,
smile, and you'll recover. ♪

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:51.340
♪ When you lose heart,
smile, and you'll recover. ♪

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:53.340
♪ Yeah, yeah, tomorrow I have
that Social Studies field trip ♪

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:55.670
♪ to the Shinjuku City Hall
Observation Lounge. ♪

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:57.680
♪ It's stunningly high,
so Hayama will be scared. ♪

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.680
♪ His pitiful face will fill my eyes. ♪

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:01.680
♪ I don't know why,
but I can't wait, can't wait! ♪

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:03.680
♪ Gonna laugh! Gonna laugh!
Gonna laugh at Hayama! ♪

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:06.020
♪ Go! Go! To City Hall!
Whoosh, let's go! ♪

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:08.850
As it turns out, the smile
you've got on is a twisted one.

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:11.820
This week's Sana-chan

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:17.700
This is lame, having to go to
City Hall on a field trip, huh?

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:19.700
I've been there a bunch of times myself.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.700
What's worse, they must not think
much of us to make us go on foot.

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:24.490
They should have chartered
about a hundred taxis.

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:30.920
Hayama! It's so rare to see
you come to an event like this.

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:34.500
What's more, it's City Hall!

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:37.050
The observation lounge
is high up, high up!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:41.550
He's got a fear of heights, and all...

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:44.640
What is it?

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.680
Haven't you talked to him?

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.980
About what? What are you talking about?

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:52.020
It's nothing.

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:54.900
What!? Hey, you're making
me feel all gross,

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:57.030
like when a burp won't come out!

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:59.700
You two sure get along, huh?

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.660
What's with you?
You're so gloomy, Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:05.700
Am I? I don't have any chance
of winning, after all...

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:07.040
What are you talking about?

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:10.670
No you don't, Tsuyoshi-kun! When
you're depressed, you've got to smile!

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:12.670
--See? Smile, smile! That's the way!
--Huh? Is that right, Aya-chan?

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:15.340
--Come on, come on!
--Oh yeah? Ewww!

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:17.050
Huh? What, what? Sounds interesting!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.010
Despicable girl...

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:22.470
Aya-chan says there's a boy
in this class that she likes!

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:24.680
Oh yeah? I hadn't heard. Who is it?

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:27.060
No way, I'm not telling.

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:29.730
It's okay, tell us, you stinker!
Come on, come on...

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:31.400
No, I can't say!

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:33.980
Sana-chan is acting
like a drunken old man!

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:37.820
If you like him, then you should declare
yourself with a kiss or two right away!

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:39.320
Like this-- *mmmwha!*

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:40.320
No way, Sana-chan!

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:42.660
Sana-chan, you're incredible!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.320
Sana-chan, that's drastic.

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:47.660
Sana-chan, have you ever kissed
your 20-year old boyfriend?

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:49.000
Of course I have.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.660
Amazing, Sana-chan!

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.580
Just an the cheek, though.

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:58.460
Welcome to the observation lounge.

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:01.260
This elevator travels 45 floors
in approximately 55 seconds,

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:02.340
202 meters above street level.

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:06.680
That's high, huh? We're going up
higher and higher, huh Hayama?

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:11.350
He really does look uncomfortable.
I feel a little sorry for him.

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:15.770
Listen up. You'll be writing essays
about your impressions here,

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:19.360
so please make some
serious observations, okay?

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:22.360
Please! I mean it.

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:25.030
--Wow! How high, how high!
--Wow! How high, how high!

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:26.700
Ah, I can see the school!

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:29.040
You're right! I wonder
if I can see my house.

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:32.370
Everyone is so small, huh?

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:32.960
What?

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:35.290
It's just that coming
someplace like this,

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:39.630
I realize how much I've been worrying
over so many little things up to now.

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:41.510
I mean, look! People are
small to begin with,

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:42.970
so if we wind ourselves up
over little things,

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:45.640
we won't be able to live in the middle
of this huge earth, you know?

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:46.970
That's what I'm saying, to put it simply.

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:49.640
Stop talking so convolutedly, would you!?

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:52.640
Sana-chan, you're strange.
Same as always, though.

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:55.650
I'm feeling great now! Refreshed!
Invigorated! And plant!

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:01.990
You can't go buying goodies--
I mean drinkies-- all alone.

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:03.320
Let me join in, too.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:07.660
It's not like that. Hisae-chan said
the elevator made her uncomfortable.

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:09.660
So I said that maybe some cold juice
would make her feel better.

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:11.540
I do feel a little bit relieved.

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:14.410
Hayama!

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:18.420
You know what? If you drink
some juice, you might feel--

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:25.680
I know you told me not to come for you...

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:33.680
You know what? Don't get
too angry about this, okay?

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:37.690
I- I really meant for nothing
bad to happen to you, see?

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:40.360
Uh, listen, they say that
if you drink some cold juice,

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:42.150
it will make you feel better,

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:45.360
so I just thought I could
help you to not feel so bad...

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:46.700
Ow, it's in my eyes,

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:49.030
of course. It must sting, huh?

00:21:49.030 --> 00:21:50.370
Oh, what should I do?

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:53.040
I'm sorry. I didn't mean
for this to happen.

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:55.370
Hayama, how about we go wash your face?

00:21:55.370 --> 00:21:58.710
It's going to get all sticky.
Come on, hurry.

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:00.210
Okay? Hurry.

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:32.410
What's going on!? What happened!?

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:42.250
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:47.760
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:52.510
In dire straits,

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:56.060
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:59.980
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:05.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:11.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:13.330
...panic!!

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:19.120
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.830
he's there.

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.090
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:27.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.220
...for two.

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.680
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.390
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:42.020
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.990
he's there,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.120
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.750
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.250
...for two.

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:09.970
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:10.970 --> 00:24:13.050
What are you doing, Hayama!?

00:24:13.050 --> 00:24:15.600
Even Rei-kun has only ever
kissed me on the cheek before!

00:24:15.600 --> 00:24:18.470
Mama, I might not be able
to go to school anymore!

00:24:18.470 --> 00:24:22.940
Oh, I can't face Rei-kun!
I know! I'll cover my face!

00:24:22.940 --> 00:24:27.940
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
Episode 9 of the Little Lost Lamb in Love
Baa-Baa Saga:

00:24:29.190 --> 00:24:32.950
"Pinch, Pinch, Sana's Love"

00:24:32.950 --> 00:24:35.660
Please look forward to it.
This has been Babbit, the white bat.
